<div class="panel">
  <div style="display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center;gap:12px">
    <h1>🖥️ {{ t('AI Desk', 'AI交易台') }}</h1>
    <span class="muted">{{ t('accountable, falsifiable leans on the trust-graded detectors — graded over time', '在可信分级检测器之上的可问责、可证伪倾向 — 并持续打分') }}</span>
  </div>
  <p class="muted sm" style="margin:10px 0 0">{{ t(
    'An AI analyst PANEL (opportunity / skeptic / base-rate / structural) reads the thematic-flow and relief-radar detectors, and a desk-head adjudicates a short set of directional leans. Each lean ships with the bear case (dissent) and a CONCRETE falsifier + check-by date, and is scored against realised prices so conviction is earned, not asserted. RESEARCH CONTEXT ONLY: a lean is a direction, never a position size or a trade — the detectors are display-only (the flow lens has no validated forward edge; the relief snap is coincident). Regenerated each day after the close.',
    '一个 AI 分析师小组（机会派／怀疑派／基率派／结构派）研读主题资金流与避险雷达检测器，再由“交易台主管”裁决出一小组方向性倾向。每个倾向都附带反方观点（异议）与一个具体的证伪条件＋检验日期，并对照真实价格打分 — 信心由战绩赢得，而非自我宣称。仅供研究参考：倾向只是方向，绝非仓位或交易 — 检测器仅作展示（资金流无经验证的前瞻性，避险信号为同步指标）。每个交易日收盘后更新。') }}</p>
</div>

